  _tutorialSprite: {fileID: -6248741079362886434, guid: fb730fb58019a604f8e2223953a42332, type: 3}
  _tutorialDialogue:
  - Ah boy ah, your father said you want to work part time is it?
  - Good lah. Can get more experience in your culture.
  - But you don't forget ah, you are my worker now. I don't want fire you but you
    try to work hard lah.
  - If you do good, I will let you to serve more customers. Maybe can pay you if
    you work full time, haha.
  - Ok, we start now. You make two drinks for me.
  - First, you make Kopi. You put the coffee, sugar, condensed milk, and water.
  - Good, you try another drink called Kopi O.
  - Kopi O is same like Kopi but they say 'O' for no condensed milk. Just put coffee
    and sugar with water.
  - "Ok, I let you serve 3 customers now, don\u2019t mess up ah!"
  skip: 0
